00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:45.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par la banque alimentaire.

00:03:43.266 --> 00:03:46.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Une bouée de sauvetage,

00:03:44.366 --> 00:03:47.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
alors que le quotidien devient

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
